.TH MOUNT_AFP "1" "January 2012" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mount_afp \- mount an AFP (AppleShare) filesystem using FUSE
.SH DESCRIPTION
This is the program which is symlinked by afp_client. See the documentation
for afp_client for information how to use this program.
.SH SEE ALSO
afp_client(1), afpfsd(1)
